= Senator Bail Organa of Alderaan

Viceroy, senator and husband to Alderaan’s queen, Bail Organa is a consensus-builder with friends in every bloc and, unusually, in the Jedi Temple.

[? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : *Our advisors can act again in [+ advisor_action_timer +] turn(s).* ?]

- @organa_diplomacy: Alderaanian diplomacy.
- @organa_inquiries: Quiet inquiries among his Jedi friends.
- @organa_fundraise: Call on Alderaan’s generosity.
- @organa_bureau: A quiet word with the Senate administrators.
- @go_back: Back.

@organa_diplomacy
subtitle: +5 relations with the Core Moderates and Independents, +3 with the Rimward Coalition.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: mod_relation += 5; ind_relation += 5; rim_relation += 3; advisor_action_timer = 5

Organa hosts a reception at the Alderaanian embassy. By the end of the evening three blocs believe he is on their side, and he is not entirely lying.

@organa_inquiries
subtitle: +0.5 evidence, +4 relations with the Jedi.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: evidence += 0.3; jedi_relation += 4; jedi_suspicion += 0.3; advisor_action_timer = 5

Organa shares tea with Jedi he has known for years. They tell him little, but what they leave unsaid is telling.

@organa_fundraise
view-if: difficulty < 1
subtitle: +1 political capital; each use irritates the Institutionalists more.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: capital += 1; inst_dissent += 3 + organa_funds * 3; organa_funds += 1; advisor_action_timer = 5

The royal house of Alderaan is generous. It is also keeping count.

@organa_bureau
subtitle: Warms the Senate bureaucracy towards us.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: bureau_relation += 8; advisor_action_timer = 5

Bail Organa never forgets a clerk's name. A few quiet dinners later, the Caucus's paperwork moves a little faster.
